  </item>
  <item>
    <title>娱乐圈韭菜实录：顶流男星、底层导演，如何被一个“站姐品牌”收割</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69785a080c314a9fed80a204</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69785a080c314a9fed80a204</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jan 2026 06:56:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期临时加更，是一份来自导演嘉宾的维权呐喊！一线明星遭自家“站姐”品牌方联手挖坑，明星本人、导演、代理方无一幸免，全成了对方不专业、不道德、不懂法之下的受害者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>德艺双馨的P姓男星，无辜“工伤”，一天被迫吞下6碗面2碗饭；</span><br><span>底层导演拼命拍摄，一天连赶8条片，竟反遭百万索赔，80%尾款至今拖欠。</span></p><span></span><p><span>临近新年，这样的打工人实录，听得人心寒又愤怒。我们节目虽小，却坚持为公平发声，替嘉宾讨回公道。愿所有努力不被辜负，愿作孽者终得应有的制裁！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一起听见真相，声援正义。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】赵总</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】瓜瓜、发发、宅宅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期聊到的小话题】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=235000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=235000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:4</a></span></a><span>0 品牌方要求将 8 条本子拍出 3 条的感觉，经纪人也知晓，但出镜的P男星本人不知道。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=467000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=467000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a></span></a><strong><span> </span></strong><span>艺人团队临时要求准备“拜拜”，原来是因为P男星是灵异体质</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=679000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=679000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:4</a></span></a><span>5</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>拍摄三机位分歧，品牌方怒发律师函索赔</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=866000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=866000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:3</a></span></a><span>3</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>P男星经纪人要求复刻舞台光，必须打出下颌线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 艺人团队和品牌方互相甩锅，可怜P男星真吃6碗面、2碗炒饭</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=1793000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=1793000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:4</a></span></a><span>9</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>品牌方总裁现场表白P男星，费用却要导演承担</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=2227000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=2227000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:1</a></span></a><span>8 品牌方无理取闹，无辜迁怒王一博</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=2489000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=2489000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:0</a></span></a><span>0 导演追4万尾款反遭品牌方索赔几百万</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=3161000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=3161000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a></span></a><span> 男星受冻，导演好心提供解决方案，反被指责坐地起价，最终品牌方自行采购多花冤枉钱</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=3431000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=3431000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:2</a></span></a><span>2</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>I do分公司人员私下索要回扣，导演反手投诉致其被开除</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=3864000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=3864000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:1</a></span></a><span>5</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>某童星女艺人因父母干涉，提前解约又拒付违约金，最终导致耽误艺人三年发展黄金期，商务机会全无。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=4267000" data-url="https://ewudx0y0c2i.feishu.cn/minutes/obcn4ov6edk77abgfkt8nq23?t=4267000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a></span></a><span> 闹剧最终受难者还是P男星，职业道德在线，可惜被自家私生饭坑</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】小兵大恒 - 团结一心讨打工钱</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果您对节目内容任何意见或建议，又或是有精彩故事想投稿分享成为节目嘉宾，欢迎通过以下方式与我们联系——</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：没有答案podcast (MYDA_podcast)</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：meiyoudaan@googlegroups.com</span></p>]]></description>
