    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Aug 2025 04:08:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提到装修，想到的都是吵架翻车？</span><br><span>咱播客的顶流树哥携“设计助理”辰儿姐返场，分享两次</span><strong><span>闻所未闻的奇葩装修</span></strong><span>！</span><br><span>但神奇的是，这超高难度副本非但没让他们“红温”，反而让感情极速“升温”。</span><br><span>这背后到底有什么魔法？本期堪比脱口秀专场，爆笑解压，一听就停不下来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】土树、辰儿姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】瓜瓜、发发、宅宅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容的相关图片】</span></p><span></span><p><span>废墟中凌乱的辰儿姐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhi03terQDFMY2-ctqOpXeZlFevj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>切墙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdFdwLEk3wg_u_JsyMLwUviVUAi.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohDk6a191JXkZngGcU5XzoYHPPc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>被浴缸和马桶占领的卧室</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSIrnBy9aSjlOsPt-_sp3VDX79G.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>橱柜拆除后的厨房</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgK6L46iGcsXiUY_Yeu_XPKjXGEW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>结构复杂的吊顶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkF1v8SjUKWl4G7max8oVa1zInGm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>给妈妈家做的非标楼梯与电梯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEnlW7jkmcc1dzMfRLELZhSY7BU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>下面是辰儿姐的高超画技展示</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhIK_6Kj4ul8TZkhJnzsuNY3qoCv.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhbHbMTP2jgPzNVEljbPdqkFhijm.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6W9aSIG1bz1RezUsaPy0MBh7Su.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyGLocC6D4Xufq7ijifMZnLv7Rh.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】小狗的骨頭 - 在哪里找到爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果您对节目内容任何意见或建议，又或是有精彩故事想投稿分享成为节目嘉宾，欢迎通过以下方式与我们联系——</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：没有答案podcast (MYDA_podcast)</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：meiyoudaan@googlegroups.com</span></p>]]></description>
