  <item>
    <title>日本7.5预言大灾？留子：让我打完这周工先</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6866270360f8f77d40a09ae2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6866270360f8f77d40a09ae2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 06:50:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「另一种人生」是《没有答案》一个系列节目，寻找在海外生活过、求学过的朋友来聊聊异国的生活是怎样的，在人生各种岔路口，换一个环境又会有怎样的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期录制时间是2025-6-13，在日本大灾预言甚嚣尘上的舆论中，我们请了一位正在东京打工的00后留学生，来聊一聊他这一年的生活，从他的视角里一起来看一看日本人的真实状况~</span></p><span></span><p><span>（剪辑师瓜瓜也是在上期爆火之后，加班加点必须赶在7月5日之前上架本期内容）</span></p><span></span><p><span>（对日本留学不感兴趣的新听众，也别取关，我们后面还会继续更新不上班系列、道士系列、区块链八卦乐子、拉拉抓马恋爱史…请继续支持我们，感谢！90度鞠躬！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】KURE</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】瓜瓜、发发、宅宅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【聊到的小话题】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">00:01:29</a> 日本人知道孙俪却不知道满岛光？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a> 日本老师沉迷《甄嬛传》学中文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">00:02:48</a> 东京街头持刀杀人事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">00:04:04</a> 中国人在日本自杀未遂引爆煤气罐的地狱笑话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">00:04:49</a> 搬家当天遭遇火灾警报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">00:06:41</a> “只留不学”的日本留学现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">00:10:36</a> 地震频发与日本人的死亡焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">00:12:00</a> 电车延误的万能借口：人身事故</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">00:14:27</a> 看动漫学日语的致命陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">00:16:48</a> 药妆店打工：拿着小时工资操着联合国心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">00:22:12</a> 东京市长免水费的神逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">00:25:09</a> 如何融入日本社会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">00:30:15</a> 敬语比预言先杀死我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">00:34:49</a> 京都人的阴阳怪气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">00:37:04</a> 中国游客迷惑行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">00:39:14</a> 在日搞笑二三事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">00:42:58</a> 日本鞠躬文化：对高个子和腰椎间盘突出症患者真的很不友好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2758">00:45:58</a> 敬语、分寸感，困住在日的所有人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3083">00:51:23</a> 客人与服务员其实是一个镜子的两面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3318">00:55:18</a> 半泽直树是日本人的精神代餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">00:57:30</a> 日本地名是新xx的，很可能这里曾经发生过可怕的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3501">00:58:21</a> 唯物主义战士怒怼日本传教士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3639">01:00:39</a> 日本人的盛情难却困住了他们自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3796">01:03:16</a> 日本留学生如何找到好工作，日本城隍保佑我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3933">01:05:33</a> 日本女大问我，能从上海到北京吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">01:07:02</a> 日本7.5地震海啸预言，留子、日本人的不同看法</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】水中スピカ - 拍動</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果您对节目内容任何意见或建议，又或是有精彩故事想投稿分享成为节目嘉宾，欢迎通过以下方式与我们联系——</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：没有答案podcast (MYDA_podcast)</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：meiyoudaan@googlegroups.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/624be9b0625b0b278be83e51/lkBCAfzkeLTrRQJmvDcfHQDZTZrd.m4a" length="158290768" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_EAGI3wkz4vvFwwpU54Lmigz2h.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
